dist/I have completed my EduQuery AI 2.0 RAG-based college chatbot.

I want to upload this existing project to my GitHub repository without installing Git locally.

Please:
1. Inspect the complete project structure.
2. Make sure the client and server are included.
3. Create an appropriate .gitignore file.
4. Make sure node_modules, .env files, API keys, passwords, MongoDB credentials, and other secrets are NOT committed.
5. Check that the project is ready to be pushed to GitHub.
6. Do not modify the working RAG functionality.
7. Do not delete any existing project files.
8. Tell me exactly what you changed before pushing anything.

